- packages/shell/macos/ShellGlass.swift: Liquid Glass plates and the
  popover bubble outline (from Ardia's GlassEffect, LiquidGlass and
  PopoverBubble).
- packages/shell/macos/ShellSystem.swift: ThinScrollBars.
- packages/shell/docktile/DockTilePlugIn.swift: the Dock tile plug-in
  (from Ardia's DockTilePlugIn).
- packages/shell/macos/AppIcons.swift: in part, how the chosen icon is
  stored, announced to the Dock tile and redrawn for the system icon style
  (from Ardia's AppIcons).
- pnpm-patches/: fixes to React Native macOS and Expo Modules Core.

All of it comes from Ardia's own source files (packages/shell and the
root patches/ folder), which Ardia licenses under Apache-2.0. None comes
from Ardia's engine patches (engine/), which are GPL-3.0.

The adapted files carry a notice saying so. Changes: renamed, reduced to
what Merlin uses, solid Classic surfaces, Merlin's colour handling.
